Verification Notes

Verification evidence shall maintain traceability between representative observations, the resulting interpreted context, and the applicable requirements.

Where interpretation is uncertain or observations are incomplete, verification shall evaluate whether the system represents and manages that uncertainty in accordance with approved requirements.
